<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
	<title>Intel Registration Confirmation - Developer Zone Premier Account</title>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	
</head>


<body style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: none;background-color: #f9f9f9;background: url(https://tstcqcontent-ssl.cps.intel.com/etc/designs/intel/us/en/images/gradiantbg-body.png) repeat-x scroll left top #f9f9f9;height: 100%;outline: medium none;font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-weight: normal;font-size: 10pt;color: #666666;">
<div id="container" style="width: 600px;margin-top: 10px;margin-right: auto;margin-bottom: 10px;margin-left: auto;position: relative;background-color: #FFFFFF;border-color: #E5E5E5;border-style: solid;padding: 25px 50px 0px 50px;border-width: 1px;overflow: hidden;line-height: 1.5em;"><header style="display: block;font-family: &quot;Intel Clear Pro&quot;, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-weight: normal;font-size: 1.1em;color: #003C71;line-height: 2em;">
<h1><img src="https://messagecenter-cons.intel.com/v1/images/uploads/5104bda0-0fc2-11ec-901e-3750230d5760.png" alt="" title="devzone-premier-header_720x160@2x.png" width="700" height="156"></h1>
<hr style="background-color: #E5E5E5;color: #E5E5E5;border: 0 none;height: 1px;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></header><main style="display: block;">
</main><p class="subjectTextStyle" style="font-size: 1.2em;font-weight: bold;color: #086DB6;line-height: 1.4em;"><span face="intel clear, sans-serif" style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;">Your Application is Pending Approval</span></p>
<p><br><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">Welcome {!PRM_Registration_Request__c.PRM_First_Name__c} {!PRM_Registration_Request__c.PRM_Last_Name__c},</span></p>
<p><span>Thank you for requesting a Developer Zone Premier account. It may take up to ten business days to review your request. </span></p>
<p><span>While your application is pending, you can engage with the Developer Zone in the following ways:</span></p>

<ol>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Explore content on <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/resources-documentation/developer.html#gs.4qikvp" class="external-link" rel="nofollow" style="color: #086DB6;">Resource & Documentation Center</a> with your Developer Zone Standard access</li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Post a question or comment to our community forums: <a href="https://communities.intel.com/" class="external-link" rel="nofollow" style="color: #086DB6;">communities.intel.com</a></li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Bookmark and follow content of interest. Access your <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/my-intel/content.html/" class="external-link" rel="nofollow" style="color: #086DB6;">bookmark list in My Intel.</a> </li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Development software downloads</li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Manage your Intel® software license and registration using the License and Entitlement Manager.</li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Access the collaboration platform where developers can share projects: Intel® DevMesh.</li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Enter contests. </li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Sign up for events: <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/developer/community/overview.html" class="external-link" rel="nofollow" style="color: #086DB6;">Developer Community and Events</a> </li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Access performance testing applications</li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Access developer training at <a href="https://learning.intel.com/developer/learn" class="external-link" rel="nofollow" style="color: #086DB6;">Intel Learn</a> </li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">Please retain this email for future reference and note that Premier access is associated with this email address {!PRM_Registration_Request__c.PRM_Email_ID__c} only. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">If you have any questions, please contact <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/support/contact-intel.html#support-intel-programs" class="external-link" rel="nofollow" style="color: #086DB6;">Intel® Customer Support</a>.</span></p>
<tr id="salutationDiv" style="padding-bottom: 5px; height: 52px;">
<td colspan="2" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; font-size: 10pt; color: #666666; padding-left: 50px; padding-top: 14px; line-height: 18px; height: 52px;">Sincerely, <br> Developer Zone Registration Administrator</td>
</tr>
<main style="display: block;">
</main><p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">Please DO NOT reply to this e-mail message. This is an automated response. To ensure that you continue receiving our e-mails, add us to your address book.</span></p>

<section style="display: block;font-size: 0.8em;font-style: italic;color: black;line-height: 1.4em;">
</section><p style="text-align: right;"></p>

